    "name": {
      "value": "Convocation Scout"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "lora"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "The Convocation is the biggest, most anticipated academic event in recent years. Eager to create long-lasting alliances as well as recruit promising students or staff to their own ranks, your school has sent you as a representative to advance their interests. Your tact, analytical ability, and gift for communication serve you well in scouting profitable partnerships with the Convocation's other sponsors and guests.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Wisdom or Charisma, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in Diplomacy. You're also trained in the Politics Lore skill or a Lore skill associated with your school. You gain the Group Impression skill feat."
    },
